{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 59,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me from mine enemies, O my God:\nSet me on high from them that rise up against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me from the workers of iniquity,\nAnd save me from the bloodthirsty men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For, lo, they lie in wait for my soul;\nThe mighty gather themselves together against me:\nNot for my transgression, nor for my sin, O Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They run and prepare themselves without ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fault:\nAwake thou to help me, and behold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even thou, O Jehovah God of hosts, the God of Israel,\nArise to visit all the nations:\nBe not merciful to any wicked transgressors. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They return at evening, they howl like a dog,\nAnd go round about the city.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, they belch out with their mouth;\nSwords are in their lips:\nFor who, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "say they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", doth hear?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou, O Jehovah, wilt laugh at them;\nThou wilt have all the nations in derision.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his strength I will give heed unto thee;\nFor God is my high tower.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My God with his lovingkindness will meet me:\nGod will let me see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my desire",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon mine enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Slay them not, lest my people forget:Scatter them by thy power, and bring them down,\nO Lord our shield.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sin of their mouth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the words of their lips,\nLet them even be taken in their pride,\nAnd for cursing and lying which they speak.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Consume them in wrath, consume them, so that they shall be no more:\nAnd let them know that God ruleth in Jacob,\nUnto the ends of the earth. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And at evening let them return, let them howl like a dog,\nAnd go round about the city.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall wander up and down for food,\nAnd tarry all night if they be not satisfied.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will sing of thy strength;\nYea, I will sing aloud of thy lovingkindness in the morning:\nFor thou hast been my high tower,\nAnd a refuge in the day of my distress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.59.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Unto thee, O my strength, will I sing praises:\nFor God is my high tower, the God of my mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer for deliverance from enemies.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician; set to Al-tashheth. A Psalm of David. Michtam; when Saul sent, and they watched the house to kill him.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
